            <ArticleTitle>[Multimodal pain therapy - implementation of process management - an attempt to consider management approaches].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>504-10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1055/s-0032-1323573</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The combination of medical and economical proceedings allows new perspectives in the illustration of medical workflows. Considering structural and developmental aspects multimodal therapy programs show similarities with typical subjects of economic process systems. By pointing out the strategic appearance of the multimodal pain therapy concept multimodal approaches can be described to some extent by using management approaches. E. g., an economic process landscape can be used to represent procedures of a multimodal pain therapy program.</AbstractText>
